D: DRIF,L=0.4
QF: KQUAD,L=0.2,K1=1.5,N_SLICES=4
QD: KQUAD,L=0.2,K1=-1.5,N_SLICES=4
B: CSBEND,L=0.3,ANGLE=0.01,N_SLICES=4
RF: RFCA,L=0,VOLT=3e6,PHASE=170,FREQ=5e8,PHASE_REFERENCE=7
R2: RFCA,L=0,VOLT=2e6,PHASE=150,FREQ=5e8,PHASE_REFERENCE=7
MA: MAXAMP,X_MAX=2e-3,Y_MAX=2e-3
RING: LINE=(MA,2*(D,QF,D,B,D,QD,D),RF,2*(D,QF,D,B,D,QD,D),R2)
